{"channelId":"UCZuClz5QTcnxMo7imtbNREg","row":["Infinite Wisdom Chiropractic",301,"Welcome to Infinite Wisdom Chiropractic — where structure meets movement, and healing happens from the inside out.\n\nLed by Dr. Justin Jones, our Orlando-based chiropractic practice is dedicated to helping you move better, feel better, and live more aligned. Our mission is simple: to reconnect you with your body’s natural wisdom through intentional chiropractic care, functional movement education, and breathwork practices that support long-term healing — not just short-term relief.\n\n📍 Based in Orlando, Florida, we serve our local community in-person and our global community through YouTube — offering step-by-step guidance on:\n\nPain relief and posture correction\nBreathwork for nervous system regulation\nFunctional movement for everyday strength and adaptability\nReal-time chiropractic care moments that inspire and educate\n\nSubscribe to join a community committed to aligned living, one adjustment and movement at a time.","Healing@infinitewisdomchiroandreiki.com","US"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZuClz5QTcnxMo7imtbNREg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZuClz5QTcnxMo7imtbNREg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:03.917Z","channelId":"UCZuClz5QTcnxMo7imtbNREg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"7811ec251a63b909017108962b231e05770d6d0455fe7e63438279a7d9e8cdfe","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"e228f014e86e417e9e561e0f93e9d87161971a7e3305477834bf3e49b2aa6e2f"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.infinitewisdomchiroandreiki.com/","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:36:02.147Z","method":"self_published_jsonld_addressCountry","entityName":"Infinite Wisdom Chiropractic"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZuClz5QTcnxMo7imtbNREg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":301,"raw":"301 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZuClz5QTc